<SCENARIO VER="105">
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\布団.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>As I was about to get into the car, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> yanked on my sleeve―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "50"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\外崎家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A strong wind full of cherry blossoms swept through.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you can't go...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Please... I'm going too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... let me see her...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She even sensed we were going to see <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You absolutely can't go just the two of you...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'm... I'm going too...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you stay here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No...! It's no good like this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No! There's no way we can take </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! I have to go! Otherwise I can't save everyone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...! It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> who's saying this!?"</STYLE><PG>
But really, all the way to Megasawa...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then again, if <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> seeing <STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE> could somehow make things better...<PG>
Now, what should I do?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Take <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> with us, or leave her behind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a very important choice.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\運転席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<PG>
